  triage:title "AI.33 admission-capacity smoke deliverable entirely absent" ;
  triage:description "req-qa confirmed via direct `ls` that scripts/smoke/run_admission_capacity.py does not exist anywhere in the tree at integrate/phase-ai-31-33 @ 05cc0d91. No admission-capacity throughput/latency evidence exists. AI.33's acceptance criteria (10/10 one-second intervals >=1,000 admissions/s, per docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-33-admission-capacity-smoke.md) is entirely unverified — not partially done, not built at all. team-lead independently confirmed via task-ledger review that AI.33 was never dispatched as a dev sprint at all (no #task entry exists for it, unlike AI.31/32/34/35/36/37/38 which all have dev-dispatch tasks) — this is not a false-completion, it was simply skipped in sprint dispatch sequencing." ;
